IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `abn-registration`

-- A New Tax System (Australian Business Number) Act 1999 (Cth), with GST Act s 9-20 -- worked cases from the seat of the
-- person carrying on an enterprise (Jake the platform rider, k040, 2027; Daniel's company Jarrah, d043, 2031).
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case, an ATO ruling or Registrar practice.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_a-new-tax-system-australian-business-number-act-1999_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts the lives do not state are ASSUMPTIONS, labelled where used: that Jake rides as a contractor, not an employee (the
-- Fair Work Act question is that Act's; it is a fact here), and expects a profit; that Jarrah's application satisfied the
-- Registrar; that the approved form asked for associates' details for Jarrah.

