§ `GST Act s 9-20 -- enterprise`

#ASSERT `Is what I do excluded from being an enterprise` `delivery riding as an employee` `an individual`
#ASSERT NOT `Is what I do excluded from being an enterprise` `a business run at a loss with no expectation of profit` `a company`

#ASSERT `Is what I do an enterprise` `delivery riding on contract (k040)` `an individual`
#ASSERT NOT `Is what I do an enterprise` `delivery riding as an employee` `an individual`
#ASSERT NOT `Is what I do an enterprise` `weekend cycling for fun` `an individual`
#ASSERT NOT `Is what I do an enterprise` `a side line with no expectation of profit` `an individual`
#ASSERT `Is what I do an enterprise` `a business run at a loss with no expectation of profit` `a company`
#ASSERT NOT `Is what I do an enterprise` `sitting as a company director for fees` `an individual`
#ASSERT `Is what I do an enterprise` `an office accepted in the course of an enterprise` `an individual`
#ASSERT NOT `Is what I do an enterprise` `serving as a local councillor` `an individual`

#ASSERT `Is it my religious institution's activity, not mine` `ministry as a member of a religious order`
#ASSERT NOT `Is it my religious institution's activity, not mine` `delivery riding on contract (k040)`

§ `s 8 -- entitlement (k040 Jake; d043 Daniel's company)`

#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jake, 20, riding for a platform on contract (k040, 2027)` EQUALS `entitled: I carry on an enterprise in Australia`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jake, if he rode as the platform's employee` EQUALS `not entitled: what I do is not an enterprise`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jake, riding only for fun` EQUALS `not entitled: what I do is not an enterprise`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jake, buying the e-bike before his first delivery` EQUALS `entitled: I carry on an enterprise in Australia`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jake, after he has stopped riding for good` EQUALS `not entitled: I am not carrying it on, starting it or winding it up`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jarrah Legal Technologies Pty Ltd, registered with ASIC (d043, 2031)` EQUALS `entitled: a Corporations Act company is entitled to an ABN`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Jarrah, registered but not yet trading` EQUALS `entitled: a Corporations Act company is entitled to an ABN`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `a Corporations Act company that is a limited registration entity` EQUALS `not entitled: a limited registration entity is not entitled to an ABN`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `Daniel, personally, as a director of Jarrah` EQUALS `not entitled: what I do is not an enterprise`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `a seller abroad supplying goods delivered in Australia` EQUALS `entitled: I make supplies connected with the indirect tax zone in carrying on my enterprise`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `a consultant abroad with no Australian supplies` EQUALS `not entitled: my enterprise is not in Australia and makes no supplies connected with the indirect tax zone`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `a priest in a religious order` EQUALS `not entitled: the activity is treated as my religious institution's, not mine`
#ASSERT `What is my ABN entitlement` `a family trust running a business at a loss` EQUALS `entitled: I carry on an enterprise in Australia`

#ASSERT `Am I entitled to an ABN` `Jake, 20, riding for a platform on contract (k040, 2027)`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I entitled to an ABN` `Jake, if he rode as the platform's employee`
#ASSERT `Am I entitled to an ABN` `Jarrah Legal Technologies Pty Ltd, registered with ASIC (d043, 2031)`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I entitled to an ABN` `a priest in a religious order`

§ `ss 9, 10, 11(2) -- applying`

#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `Jake's online application (k040)` EQUALS `the Registrar must register me and allocate me an ABN`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `Jarrah's application, with its shareholders as associates (d043)` EQUALS `the Registrar must register me and allocate me an ABN`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `an application by letter, not the approved form` EQUALS `the Registrar need not register me: I have not applied in the approved form`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `a second application by someone already registered` EQUALS `the Registrar need not register me: I am already registered`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `an application the Registrar doubts is an enterprise` EQUALS `the Registrar need not register me: not satisfied I am or will be entitled`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `an application with identity not established` EQUALS `the Registrar need not register me: not satisfied of my identity`
#ASSERT `What happens to my application for an ABN` `an application with an associate's identity not established` EQUALS `the Registrar need not register me: not satisfied of my associate's identity`

#ASSERT NOT `Must I give my TFN to get an ABN` TRUE

#ASSERT `Can my registration take effect from that date` 20270310 20270306

